# ResideWell CFO Pricing & Metrics

When creating pricing models, dashboards, or forecasts:

## Use conservative assumptions

- instructor cost per class: $65–$85
- event facilitator cost: $200–$400
- event supplies: $100–$300
- target gross margin: 45%+
- standard pilot price: $4,000
- minimum pilot price: $3,500
- standard annual package: $21,600/year

## Weekly KPIs

- properties researched
- contacts added
- emails sent
- LinkedIn touches
- reply rate
- discovery calls booked
- proposals sent
- pilots closed
- active pilots
- active annual contracts
- monthly recurring revenue
- gross margin
- attendance per class
- resident satisfaction

## Guardrails

- do not underprice to win a deal
- do not present unsupported ROI claims
- express annual pricing in monthly and per-unit terms when useful
- prefer simple dashboards over complex financial models in the first 90 days
